      "baseRefOid": "ab4c92c428a2c2c9ab284a83f79f726418c1498b",
      "body": "The fresh CLI install exposed pinned-version rejection in Slskd/Tracearr and Homarr retry failures around referenced App records. This candidate preserves the existing peer PRs, fixes those failures, adds native AdGuard/Paperless verification, bounds owned Stats widgets, and confines the reusable smoke helper.\n\nOne Project installed 37 peers plus Homarr: 55 services, 25 saved integrations and 24 reviewed native/shared widgets. The repaired Homarr retry had zero failed steps. Full Go tests, build/vet, affected race checks and independent Standards/Spec reviews pass. Scope and evidence: `docs/release-handoff.md`.\n\nKeep draft: Speedtest awaits the shared-host AppArmor decision; account/hardware/privacy prerequisites, complete peer lifecycle acceptance, eval judgments and anonymous release distribution remain outstanding. No original peer PR was merged or rewritten.\n",
